From efd14b981b52954cc11b57ab156e87fcb82609cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] arm64: mediatek: validate live A34 admission predicates

A34 compared the complete raw physical snapshot against an
injected fixture whose unspecified live registers were zero.
Exact device evidence shows valid nonzero per-core MP2 and CCI
state plus unrelated A53 CPU-status movement.

Validate the documented CPU8-off topology, owner, replay,
provider, MP2, isolation, DCM, CCI and source-validity predicates
instead. Keep A72 status bits fail-closed while excluding
unrelated A53 and raw clock payloads from authorization.
